      "id": "D11-02",
      "doc": "m0-d11-vendors.md",
      "rule": "A material provider requires a current SOC 2 report, ISO/IEC 27001 certificate, or, if neither exists, a completed security questionnaire, reviewed at onboarding and at least annually; a non-material provider needs only a recorded classification rationale."
