  "decides": "A review records evidence kind soc2_type1, soc2_type2, iso27001 or questionnaire, with the questionnaire accepted only when no SOC 2 report or ISO/IEC 27001 certificate exists; its next review due date is after the review date and, for a material provider, no more than 12 months after it. A non-material provider needs only its recorded classification rationale.",
